		{"id":"proj-scp-sourcingchatbot-v2-3-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n\nSourcing AI Chatbot\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: AI APPLICATION (RAG / chatbot)\nStatus: Production\nBaseline code: SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3\n\nCapability: Supplier, material and sample search, comparison and sourcing knowledge retrieval.","x":100,"y":2180,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"poc-faceworks-ai","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Faceworks AI]]\n\nStatus: Technology Assessment\nType: VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Potential garment/textile AI capabilities under evaluation.\nNo operational integration assumed.","x":-3800,"y":3040,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-sortech","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Sortech]]\n\nStatus: Technology / SI Assessment\nType: VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Potentially relevant to invoice automation, GRN workflows, WFX automation, reconciliation, approvals, agentic workflows and smart-factory integration.\nNo operational integration assumed.","x":-2250,"y":3040,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-quanskill","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Quanskill]]\n\nStatus: Vendor / Product Evaluation\nType: VENDOR EVALUATION (discovery item, not a project)\n\nScope: Not yet an approved implementation project.\nNo operational integration assumed.","x":-3800,"y":3460,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"legend-nodes","type":"text","text":"## NODE CATEGORIES\n\nWFX ERP - purple\nThird-Party System - brown\nGTAS Internal System - indigo\nData / Knowledge Platform - teal\nShared AI Platform - pink group\nAI / Automation / Workflow / IoT project - card colour = STATUS (right)\nThe Type line on each card names the class:\nAI APPLICATION | AUTOMATION | WORKFLOW | DATA PLATFORM |\nINTERNAL PLATFORM | IOT | POC / EVALUATION | COLLABORATION | ARCHIVED","x":-3800,"y":4220,"width":3000,"height":700},
		{"id":"legend-edges","type":"text","text":"## RELATIONSHIPS (label prefix, never colour alone)\n\nINTEGRATION | implemented / confirmed operational integration (green line)\nPLANNED | planned or in-development integration (orange line)\nAFFINITY | business capability affinity, no technical integration confirmed (plain line)\nDATA | data / knowledge dependency (blue line)\n\nCanvas edges cannot be dashed or thinned, so the prefix carries the meaning.","x":-3800,"y":4960,"width":3000,"height":700},
		{"id":"legend-status","type":"text","text":"## STATUS COLOUR (source status text is kept on each card)\n\nGreen - Production / Operational\nBlue - Active / Development / Strategic Active\nYellow - UAT / Evaluation / Pre-PoC / Analysis\nOrange - On Hold\nGrey-blue - Maintenance / Support\nGrey - Closed / Archived","x":-3800,"y":5700,"width":3000,"height":680},
		{"id":"proj-mer-costingagenticplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nAgentic Costing Platform\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nType: AI APPLICATION (agents / decision support)\nStatus: Active Development\nBaseline code: COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1\n\nCapability: Costing and quotation package: Sew Agent, Wash Agent, BOM, consumption, similar style. AI proposes, domain expert approves.","x":100,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-marketintelligence-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n\nMarket Intelligence\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nType: AI APPLICATION (data intelligence)\nStatus: Active Intelligence\nBaseline code: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1\n\nCapability: Market, customer, product and material opportunity signals from external data and internal history.\nIntelligence layer - not a system of record.\nData input: Enterprise Data / DWH and sales / PO / fabric history (no edge drawn - see guide).","x":100,"y":580,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-adhocindentsouth-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam|PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0]]\n\nAdhoc Indent Automation (South)\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: AUTOMATION (rule-based)\nStatus: Maintenance\nBaseline code: PUR.Adhoc.Indent.South.v1.0\n\nCapability: Repeated Adhoc Indent processing for the South region; WFX compatibility.","x":100,"y":2600,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-hmlabelprocessing-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n\nH&M Label-O Processing\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: AUTOMATION (rule-based)\nStatus: On Hold\nBaseline code: PUR.HM.LabelO.Processing.Automation.v1.0\n\nCapability: H&M Label-O processing; paused pending a scalable business case.","x":100,"y":3020,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-inventoryreport-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report|PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0]]\n\nPurchasing Inventory Report\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: DATA PLATFORM (reporting / visibility)\nStatus: Production\nBaseline code: PUR.Inventory.Report.v2.1\n\nCapability: Purchasing inventory and material visibility. A data-visibility layer, not an automation bot.","x":100,"y":3440,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-materialallocation-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n\nMaterial Allocation Automation\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: AUTOMATION (workflow / transaction)\nStatus: Validation / Stabilization\nBaseline code: PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1\n\nCapability: Surplus-material unreserve and reallocation across OCs. First Sewing / Embroidery flow validated.","x":100,"y":3860,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-gdiautomation-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n\nGDI Automation\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nType: AUTOMATION (API-first transaction)\nStatus: Active Development / WFX API Integration\nBaseline code: PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0\n\nCapability: Goods dispatch / GDI data entry through WFX GET / POST APIs; API specification and UAT still ahead.\nSystem of Record: WFX.","x":100,"y":4280,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-wh-awbextraction-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n\nAWB Document Intelligence\n\nDomain: Warehouse\nType: AI APPLICATION (document intelligence)\nStatus: Active Development\nBaseline code: WH.AWB.EXTRACTION.v1.1\n\nCapability: AWB image OCR and DHL email parsing into one validated canonical AWB record; human validation.","x":100,"y":5040,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-log-expenseinvoiceprocessing-v1-2-2","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2]]\n\nExpense Invoice Processing\n\nDomain: Logistics / EXIM\nType: AUTOMATION (regional invoice)\nStatus: Regional Rollout / UAT\nBaseline code: PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 + LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 (one project in the vault)\n\nCapability: Logistics / EXIM expense invoices: regional and tax rules, validation, exceptions. Regions: HCM, Da Nang, Nha Trang, Ha Noi.\nMerged in the vault registry - see gap note 1.","x":100,"y":5460,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"eco-title","type":"text","text":"# PPJ GROUP\n## Digital Application, AI & Automation Ecosystem","x":0,"y":-1500,"width":9300,"height":240},
		{"id":"eco-subtitle","type":"text","text":"ERP -> Enterprise Applications -> Internal Systems -> AI & Automation\n\nPortfolio Baseline: 19/09/2026  |  Vault Reconciliation: 24/09/2026 (portfolio snapshot)\nGenerated From: PPJ AI & Automation Portfolio (vault registry) + PPJ operating-systems landscape ([[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape|Operational Systems Landscape]]). Regenerated automatically when the portfolio snapshot changes.","x":0,"y":-1230,"width":9300,"height":260},
		{"id":"eco-exec-summary","type":"text","text":"## PPJ DIGITAL EVOLUTION\n\n1. WFX provides the ERP transaction backbone.\n2. Third-party enterprise applications provide specialized capabilities.\n3. GTAS applications were built internally to fill operational capability gaps.\n4. AI & Automation projects now add an intelligence and automation layer across existing processes.\n5. Shared data, knowledge and AI platforms increasingly serve reusable cross-functional capabilities.\n6. AI does not replace the ERP; it augments ERP, enterprise systems and business decision-making.","x":0,"y":-940,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"eco-principles","type":"text","text":"## ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES\n\n- WFX remains core ERP / transaction backbone.\n- AI projects augment rather than duplicate source systems.\n- System of record must remain explicit.\n- Prefer API-based integration where available.\n- Business affinity does not imply technical integration.\n- Human review remains required for uncertain AI decisions.\n- Reusable data / knowledge layers serve multiple projects.\n- Shared AI services reduce duplicate implementations.\n- Status and lifecycle are independent from business domain.","x":3200,"y":-940,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"eco-inventory","type":"text","text":"## PORTFOLIO INVENTORY\n\nBaseline 19/09/2026 (35 initiatives):\nActive / Dev 16 | Production 6 | Maintenance 4 | Closed 4 | On Hold 3 | Evaluation 2\n\nCurrent Vault 24/09/2026 (36 registered records, recomputed):\nProduction 8 | Active / Dev 9 | UAT / Eval / Analysis 5 | Maintenance 4 | On Hold 3 | Closed 7\n\nBaseline is kept unchanged. Bucket definitions differ - see the gap notes.","x":6400,"y":-940,"width":2900,"height":640},
		{"id":"proj-mer-invoicedatarecheck-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n\nInvoice Data Recheck\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nType: AUTOMATION (audit / rule engine)\nStatus: Production / Support\nBaseline code: MER.INVOICE.DATA.RECHECK.v1.1\n\nCapability: Cross-check costing, commercial and invoice data with configurable customer rule packs; exceptions go to human review.","x":100,"y":1000,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-pocommit-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n\nPO Commit Automation\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nType: AUTOMATION\nStatus: Closed\nBaseline code: MER.PO.Commit.v1.1\n\nCapability: Customer order to MER PO creation; about 70-80% of customer scenarios covered. Historical record.","x":100,"y":1420,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
