		{"id":"proj-ppjxnunox-scantrial","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX|PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial]]\n\nNUNOX Scan Trial\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nType: POC / EVALUATION\nStatus: Partnership / Digital Library Evaluation\n\nCapability: Fabric scanning and Fabric / Garment Digital Library evaluation. Session outcome unconfirmed.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT. No operational integration assumed.","x":-2250,"y":2200,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-cand-cpd-in-house-pattern-generation","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n\nStatus: Internal Prototype / Evaluation\nType: CANDIDATE (not a registered project)\n\nCapability: Build an internal pattern-generation benchmark from techpack/image/measurement inputs with Pattern Engineer and CAD validation.\nCanonical code not confirmed.","x":-3800,"y":2620,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
