		{"id":"proj-ai-perriplatform-v3-2-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot|AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0]]\n\nPERRI Enterprise Chatbot\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nType: INTERNAL PLATFORM (shared AI channel)\nStatus: Production\nBaseline code: PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot.v3.2\n\nCapability: Enterprise Q&A and orchestration: intent, agent / tool, controlled response. Not a business-domain application.\nEnterprise knowledge access: no per-project dependency drawn.","x":2325,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-applicationhub-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1|AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0]]\n\nPPJ AI Hub\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nType: INTERNAL PLATFORM (shared AI access layer)\nStatus: Internal Production Platform\nBaseline code: PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1\n\nCapability: AI application discovery, access and launch layer. Not the project registry.\nNo project is drawn as using AI Hub - none is confirmed.","x":3925,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
