		{"id":"tp-iot-wiser-ina","type":"text","text":"**IoT / WISER / INA**\nMachine and production-line data\n(vault-confirmed, not on the diagram)","x":6030,"y":3200,"width":1200,"height":160,"color":"#a0522d"},
		{"id":"tp-note","type":"text","text":"Six of these are drawn on the owner's operating-systems diagram: HRIS, E-office, MMSx, FastReactPlan, Gerber, ShapeShifter.\n\nVNPT E-Invoice, Power BI, GLPI and IoT / WISER / INA are confirmed by vault documents but are not on that diagram.\n\nOnly listed applications are drawn. No further vendor application is assumed.","x":3390,"y":2400,"width":2520,"height":560},
		{"id":"proj-prod-hanginglineiot-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n\nHanging Line IoT\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nType: IOT\nStatus: Development\nBaseline code: PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0\n\nCapability: Production hanging-line digitalization and monitoring. IoT / operational, not an LLM application.","x":7750,"y":5300,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-ppj-glpi-helpdesk-ai-chatbot-v1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot|PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0]]\n\nGLPI Helpdesk AI Chatbot\n\nDomain: Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms\nType: AI APPLICATION (IT helpdesk)\nStatus: Maintenance\n\nCapability: IT helpdesk Q&A, troubleshooting, ERP support and resolved-issue knowledge. Separate from PERRI.","x":5525,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"shared-note","type":"text","text":"Conceptual direction: business AI applications -> PPJ AI Hub -> shared AI services / governance / knowledge / models.\nEdges to AI Hub or PERRI are drawn only where documentation confirms use. None is confirmed today.","x":2325,"y":580,"width":4650,"height":220},
		{"id":"guide","type":"text","text":"## ARCHITECTURE INTERPRETATION GUIDE\n\nRead the centre stack top to bottom: shared AI platforms, GTAS internal applications, third-party applications, WFX ERP core, data / knowledge foundation. It is a layered ecosystem, not a strict dependency stack.\n\nDomain groups sit left and right of the stack, next to the systems they relate to.\n\nPosition is not architecture. A line exists only where a vault document supports it, and its label says how strong it is. No line means no relationship is documented.\n\nMost integrations are therefore drawn as AFFINITY. Nothing is drawn as INTEGRATION unless a validated flow exists.","x":9600,"y":2360,"width":3200,"height":1100},
		{"id":"gap-1","type":"text","text":"DATA / GOVERNANCE GAP 1 - Expense invoices merged\n\nThe 35-item baseline lists PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 and LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 as two projects. The vault registry (PPJ_PORTFOLIO_SNAPSHOT_20260918) already maps both to ONE project, LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2, and lists a decision still open: confirm the mapping and whether the earlier Export exclusion applies.\n\nDrawn as one node (vault registry outranks the baseline). Both baseline names are kept on the card.\n\nVault also holds two closed records outside the baseline: EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1 and AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606 - hence 36 records at the time of writing.","x":9700,"y":3800,"width":3000,"height":500},
		{"id":"gap-2","type":"text","text":"DATA / GOVERNANCE GAP 2 - Canonical codes and status\n\nACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3 (baseline) vs ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0 (vault canonical). The vault says the GRNInvoiceMatching name is misleading; the canonical code is used.\n\nPPJxStratova.AI: baseline says Active PoC; vault says Closed and tracks the live PoC as DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC. Vault used.\n\nPPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0: baseline says Merchandising / Shared; vault domain is Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms. Vault used.","x":9700,"y":4340,"width":3000,"height":500},
		{"id":"gap-3","type":"text","text":"DATA / GOVERNANCE GAP 3 - Systems inventory\n\nSource: owner's operating-systems diagram. GTAS has 16 applications, not 15: GTAS Costing was missing from the list in circulation.\n\nMMSx (diagram) vs MMX (2026-09-18 ecosystem note): treated as one system, name unconfirmed.\n\nThe Finance AI canvas also names GTAS Factory, Quantity, Efficiency and ID. None is on the diagram; alias or separate application is unconfirmed.\n\nThe red star on GTAS Costing and the green highlight on Production Planning are shown but their meaning is not stated.","x":9700,"y":4880,"width":3000,"height":500},
		{"id":"gap-4","type":"text","text":"DATA / GOVERNANCE GAP 4 - Relationship evidence\n\nNo document confirms an integration at WFX-module or GTAS-application level. Those links are AFFINITY.\n\nExceptions drawn stronger: PUR_MaterialAllocation validated flow into WFX (INTEGRATION, validated flow only); FIN_InvoiceDownloader to VNPT (INTEGRATION); PUR_GDIAutomation WFX API, ADMIN_ExpenseManagement E-office and MER_CostingAgenticPlatform GTAS/IED contract are in scope but not delivered (PLANNED).\n\nStatus counts: baseline buckets and the recomputed buckets differ (e.g. UAT and Analysis are one bucket here), so the two rows are not directly comparable.","x":9700,"y":5420,"width":3000,"height":500},
		{"id":"proj-admin-expensemanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0|ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0]]\n\nBusiness Travel & Expense Management\n\nDomain: Administration\nType: WORKFLOW\nStatus: Active / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\nBaseline code: Admin Expense Management.v1.1\n\nCapability: Request, approval, trip, advance, expense, settlement; multi-traveler requests. E-office integration is in scope.","x":7750,"y":920,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-fin-financemanagement-v1-2-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n\nFinance AI Management\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nType: AI APPLICATION (finance analytics platform)\nStatus: Strategic Active\nBaseline code: FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2\n\nCapability: WS1 financial Q&A; WS2 OC cost and profitability control; WS3 factory cost integrity. Cross-system finance intelligence.\nData sources: WFX + DWH + GTAS / BI sources. Not a financial system of record.","x":7750,"y":1680,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-inventoryreport-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0|ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0]]\n\nAccounting Inventory Report\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nType: DATA PLATFORM (reporting)\nStatus: Closed\nBaseline code: ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0\n\nCapability: Accounting inventory reporting. Distinct from the Purchasing Inventory Report.","x":7750,"y":2940,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-qc-defectdetection-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0]]\n\nAI Defect Detection\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nType: AI APPLICATION (computer vision)\nStatus: On Hold\nBaseline code: PPJxQSee.AI\n\nCapability: Image, defect detection, classification, QC review. Vendor proposal and NDA only - not an approved PoC.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT.","x":7750,"y":4120,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"proj-qc-threadtraceability-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n\nRFID Thread Traceability\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nType: POC / EVALUATION\nStatus: Pre-PoC / Business Case\nBaseline code: QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0\n\nCapability: RFID thread identification and traceability. Business case only; no PoC approved.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT. No operational integration assumed.","x":7750,"y":4540,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-samplingmanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n\nWash Sampling Management Portal\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nType: WORKFLOW\nStatus: Analysis / Product Design\nBaseline code: WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1\n\nCapability: Wash sample request, planning, result and approval in the PPJ Group Portal.","x":7750,"y":5720,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-cowash-v2-0-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0]]\n\nCOWASH Wash Operations\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nType: SYSTEM / APPLICATION (production wash platform)\nStatus: On Hold\nBaseline code: PROD.COWASH.v2.0\n\nCapability: Wash production workflow and operational data. Distinct from the sampling portal.","x":7750,"y":6140,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"proj-hr-employeedataplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nHR Employee Data Platform\n\nDomain: HR\nType: WORKFLOW (data standardization)\nStatus: Production / Expansion\nBaseline code: HR.SSPFD.Workflow.v1.1\n\nCapability: Employee data collection, validation and standardization into an Employee Master; applicant extraction / prefill.","x":7750,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-fin-invoicedownloader-v1-2-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2|FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0]]\n\nInvoice Downloader\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nType: AUTOMATION\nStatus: Production\nBaseline code: PPJ.InvoiceDownloader.v1.2\n\nCapability: Downloads VNPT e-invoice files: session / cookie management and file retrieval. No accounting entry.","x":7750,"y":2100,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-grnsupplierinvoicebot-v2-3-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n\nGRN Supplier Invoice Bot\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nType: AUTOMATION (transaction bot)\nStatus: Production Support\nBaseline code: ACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3 (vault calls this name misleading)\n\nCapability: Validation, business rules and automated data entry for GRN and supplier invoices.\nProcess affinity also: Logistics In-bound (GRN), Purchase Order Management.","x":7750,"y":2520,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-exim-expenseinvoices-automation-v1-1","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1|EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1]]\n\nEXIM Expense Invoice Bot (legacy)\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nType: AUTOMATION\nStatus: Closed\n\nCapability: Legacy EXIM expense-invoice automation, replaced by LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2.\nNot in the 35-item baseline; present in the vault registry.","x":7750,"y":3360,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-ext-academiccollaboration-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1|EXT_AcademicCollaboration_v1.1.0]]\n\nAcademic Collaboration (UIT)\n\nDomain: External Collaboration\nType: COLLABORATION\nStatus: Active / Problem Framing\nBaseline code: PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1\n\nCapability: Academic collaboration: prototypes, research, competitions, talent pipeline. Not a production application.\nStream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT.","x":9700,"y":160,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-automation-workshop-analysis-202606","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/Workshop Analysis|AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606]]\n\nWorkshop Analysis (June 2026)\n\nDomain: External Collaboration\nType: ARCHIVED (enablement)\nStatus: Closed\n\nCapability: Workshop analysis record. No active tasks.\nNot in the 35-item baseline; present in the vault registry.","x":9700,"y":1340,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
