		{"id":"proj-td-technicalknowledgeplatform-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n\nTechnical Knowledge Platform\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nType: DATA PLATFORM (knowledge foundation)\nStatus: Sync Validation & Stabilization\nBaseline code: TD.TechnicalKnowledge.Platform.v2.1\n\nCapability: Reusable technical knowledge for pattern, BOM, consumption, costing, sew, wash and technical search.\nKnowledge / data foundation - not an ERP system of record.","x":2050,"y":6200,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-fab-fabricdatamart-v2-2-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2|FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0]]\n\nFabric Datamart\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nType: DATA PLATFORM (datamart)\nStatus: Support\nBaseline code: FD.Datamart.v2.2\n\nCapability: Fabric, Hanger, QR and material reference data (Directus). Separate from CPD.","x":3600,"y":6200,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-cpd-visualsampledatamart-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/CPD.Datamart.v1.1|CPD_VisualSampleDatamart_v1.1.0]]\n\nVisual Sample Datamart\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nType: DATA PLATFORM (datamart)\nStatus: Maintenance\nBaseline code: CPD.Datamart.v1.1\n\nCapability: 3D / visual sample library and image search. Separate from FD.","x":2050,"y":6620,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-ppjxstratova-ai","type":"text","text":"## [[03_Projects/PPJxStratova AI|PPJxStratova.AI]]\n\nStratova AI (historical)\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nType: ARCHIVED (former AI PoC)\nStatus: Closed\n\nCapability: Closed in the vault registry. The current pattern-generation PoC is tracked as DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC (zone 06).\nBusiness affinity: Gerber, ShapeShifter - no integration confirmed.","x":3600,"y":6620,"width":1450,"height":380,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"flow-labels","type":"text","text":"## CAPABILITY FLOWS\n(explanatory - not integrations)\n\nSOURCING\nSupplier > Material > Search > Decision\n\nPURCHASING\nPO > Material > Allocation > Dispatch\n\nMERCHANDISING\nMarket > Costing > Quotation > PO\n\nPRODUCTION\nPlanning > Production > Wash > QC\n\nFINANCE\nTransaction > Reporting > Cost Control > RCA\n\nLOGISTICS\nShipment > AWB > Tracking > Invoice\n\nADMIN\nRequest > Approval > Booking > Advance > Expense > Settlement\n\nTECHNICAL\nFabric > Pattern > BOM > Knowledge > Costing","x":5550,"y":6040,"width":1800,"height":1000},
